# Stiltzkin, Moogle Merchant: on turn 3 Bot1 pays {2} with two Moxen (its pool empty after), refused itself ("another") and
# Bot2's Ornithopter ("you control"), and gives its Memnite to Bot2, drawing a card (hand 1 to 2). On turn 5 it targets its
# Black Lotus and sacrifices the Lotus in response: the permanent target is illegal, so nothing changes hands and Bot1 draws
# nothing (CR 608.2b). On turn 7 it attacks for 1 with lifelink (CR 702.15b).

